{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2182","id":4939344880,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAivEQM8AAAABJmhr8A","html_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2182","diff_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2182.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2182.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/issues/2182","number":2182,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: make logcat collection cancellable across supported Android versions","user":{"login":"X2M7","id":239118790,"node_id":"U_kgDODkCpxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239118790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7","html_url":"https://github.com/X2M7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Leaving or reopening the log viewer can leave a blocked reader or stale stream ownership behind. Own Logcat children through cancellation and stream cleanup, subscribe before reading, and prevent an old completion from clearing a newer stream. Keep the supported API21 commands/PID filter, portable export filename, and bounded log windows with explicit omission notices.\n\nFollowing the review feedback, `9f95cb57` inlines viewer startup with the normal lifecycle launch default and restores unused general Process extensions to their upstream behavior. The existing inner subscription is installed before the reader starts; a cancelled lifecycle does not enter the outer task. Cancellation and finalization share one release operation, so process destruction is not repeated. The reader keeps standard `use` exception handling; fallback stream closing remains necessary to unblock cancellation. Cleanup retains the primary failure and a small cancellation-cause handling step required by an assertions-enabled cancellation regression test; the generic exception-graph machinery is removed. The extra fixed deployment-log timeouts are also removed.\n\nValidation for this revision:\n\n- 46 Process/Logcat/LogBuffer cases pass with JVM assertions enabled. Their tested inputs are unchanged at this head; the LogView follow-up is checked separately by source review, style and CI. These cases cover real child cancellation, IO parallelism one, cancellation before reader entry, single release and primary-error propagation.\n- Style and patch checks pass.\n- [Current upstream PR CI](https://github.com/osfans/trime/actions/runs/39900491225): 5/5 jobs passed; application unit-test and Lint tasks executed. The CI merge and targeted host tests are separate scopes; no exported full-application testcase count is inferred.\n\n[Current source, original results and limits](https://github.com/X2M7/trime/blob/599b26cfbbec22f753ce421fe1d7abf895cf7d00/doc/contribution-split/checks/review-slim-20261023/README.md) are outside this application patch. Ownership guarantees apply to the Logcat path, not the restored general extensions. No 2/5-second deployment limit, new Android runtime, performance, Release or zero-warning acceptance is claimed; earlier device results remain historical.\n","created_at":"2026-10-20T16:58:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:46:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3d4817ec4540b3bfefffded8f1757888da0dfcc4","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/